-- HR HUB OWNERSHIP SEED (simulation wave 6, item 9; founder decision,
-- Joshua 2026-10-31: "HR must have Payroll, Timecards, and Attendance
-- in the Employee Hub... use what other platforms do like Paycor").
--
-- The hr canonical pack gains hub.view_team, hub.review_timecards and
-- hub.approve_payroll: HR owns payroll/time. This refresh regenerates
-- the canonical matrix from src/data/permissions.ts and merges MISSING
-- keys into role_templates / agency_roles (m.permissions || stored —
-- the stored side wins per key), the same seed rule as
-- 20261031170000_hm_corrective_actions_seed.sql: a stored value is
-- never overwritten, so an agency that deliberately set one of these
-- keys keeps its choice in its stored template.
--
-- Note: the app ALSO accepts the HR role directly for these three
-- gates (hasHubTeamPermission in src/data/permissions.ts), so HR hub
-- access does not depend on this seed reaching a stored template —
-- the founder decision is role-level. This migration makes the
-- canonical matrix and freshly seeded templates agree with it.
